<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>3D Gaussian Splatting — House Scanner</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --card-bg: #12121c;
      --card-border: #2a2a3d;
      --accent: #6c5ce7;
      --accent-light: #a29bfe;
      --text: #e2e2f0;
      --text-dim: #9090b0;
      --green: #00e676;
      --orange: #ffa726;
      --red: #ef5350;
      --font-mono: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* ── Animated background ── */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 20%, rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 80%, rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* ── Header ── */
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--green));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    header .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .badge-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .badge {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent-light);
    }

    /* ── Sections ── */
    section {
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    section h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    section h2 .icon {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    /* ── Cards ── */
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      color: var(--accent-light);
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .card code {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--green);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    /* ── Steps ── */
    .steps {
      counter-reset: step;
    }

    .step {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.2rem 1.2rem 3.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      position: relative;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .step:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

    .step::before {
      counter-increment: step;
      content: counter(step);
      position: absolute;
      left: 1rem;
      top: 1.2rem;
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: white;
    }

    .step h4 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .step pre {
      background: #0d0d18;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .step pre code {
      background: none;
      padding: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    /* ── Table ── */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    th {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    }

    td {
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    tr:hover td { background: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.04); }

    /* ── Action buttons ── */
    .actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #5a4bd1);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.5);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.15);
    }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* ── Checkboxes ── */
    .checklist label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .checklist input[type="checkbox"] {
      accent-color: var(--accent);
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      margin-top: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── Status bar ── */
    .status-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    .status-item {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .status-item .label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .status-item .value {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .status-item .value.green { color: var(--green); }
    .status-item .value.orange { color: var(--orange); }

    /* ── Comparison stars ── */
    .stars { color: var(--orange); }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 0;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    /* ── Nav tabs ── */
    .nav-tabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 0.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .nav-tab {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: fit-content;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-tab:hover { color: var(--text); }

    .nav-tab.active {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
    }

    .tab-content { display: none; }
    .tab-content.active { display: block; }

    /* ── Collapsible ── */
    details {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    details[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); }

    summary {
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    summary::before { content: '▸'; transition: transform 0.2s; }
    details[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }

    .details-content {
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .details-content code {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      color: var(--green);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    /* ── Clickable URL in code ── */
    .url-link {
      color: var(--accent-light);
      text-decoration: underline;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .url-link:hover { color: var(--green); }

    .service-link {
      color: var(--accent-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--accent-light);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .service-link:hover { color: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }

    /* ── Responsive ── */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
      .container { padding: 1rem; }
      .step { padding-left: 3rem; }
      .step::before { left: 0.8rem; }
    }

    /* ── Animations ── */
    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .card, .step, .status-item, .actions .btn {
      animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-out backwards;
    }

    .card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .step:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .step:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .step:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

  <!-- ── Header ── -->
  <header>
    <h1>🏠 3D House Scanner</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Photogrammetry &amp; 3D Gaussian Splatting — Windows 11 Setup</p>
    <div class="badge-row">
      <span class="badge">🖥️ Skadoosh</span>
      <span class="badge">🎮 RTX 5060 12GB</span>
      <span class="badge">⚡ Ryzen 7 3800x</span>
      <span class="badge">💾 32 GB RAM</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ── Navigation ── -->
  <div class="nav-tabs" id="navTabs">
    <button class="nav-tab active" onclick="showTab('setup')">⚡ Setup</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showTab('capture')">📸 Capture</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showTab('hardware')">🖥️ Hardware</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showTab('tools')">🛠️ Tools</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showTab('viewer')">👁️ View</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showTab('formats')">📦 Formats</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- TAB: Setup -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="tab-content active" id="tab-setup">

    <!-- Status -->
    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">📊</span> System Readiness</h2>
      <div class="status-grid">
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">GPU</div>
          <div class="value green">RTX 5060 ✅</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">VRAM</div>
          <div class="value green">12 GB ✅</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">Est. Train Time</div>
          <div class="value orange">45–90 min</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">Arch</div>
          <div class="value green">Blackwell ✅</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Two paths -->
    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">🚀</span> Choose Your Path</h2>

      <div class="card" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--green);">
        <h3>⚡ Easy Path: OpenSplat (Recommended)</h3>
        <p>One binary. One command. No dependencies.</p>
        <div class="step">
          <h4>1. Download OpenSplat</h4>
          <p>Get the Windows installer:</p>
          <pre><a href="https://github.com/pierotofy/OpenSplat/releases" target="_blank" class="url-link" style="color: var(--green); text-decoration: none;">📥 github.com/pierotofy/OpenSplat/releases</a></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h4>2. Capture &amp; Run</h4>
          <pre><code>"C:\Program Files\OpenSplat\opensplat.exe" --input "C:\photos\*.jpg" --output "C:\output\house.ply"</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h4>3. View</h4>
          <p>Open the result in <a href="https://superspl.at/editor" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent-light);">SuperSplat Editor</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);">
        <h3>🔧 Flexible Path: Nerfstudio</h3>
        <p>Full pipeline. More control. CLI-based.</p>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <h4>1. Install dependencies</h4>
            <pre><code>C:\Users\shade\pidev_proj\install-nerfstudio.bat</code></pre>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <h4>2. Capture photos</h4>
            <p>See the <a href="#tab-capture" onclick="showTab('capture')" style="color: var(--accent-light); cursor: pointer;">Capture Guide</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <h4>3. Train</h4>
            <pre><code>C:\Users\shade\pidev_proj\train-splat.bat "C:\photos" "C:\output"</code></pre>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <h4>4. View</h4>
            <pre><code>C:\Users\shade\pidev_proj\open-viewer.bat</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Quick actions -->
    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">⚡</span> Quick Actions</h2>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="https://github.com/pierotofy/OpenSplat/releases" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">
          📥 Download OpenSplat
        </a>
        <a href="https://superspl.at/editor" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">
          👁️ Open SuperSplat
        </a>
        <a href="https://swyvl.io/tools/gaussian-splat-viewer" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">
          🌐 Swyvl Viewer
        </a>
        <a href="https://colmap.github.io/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">
          📐 COLMAP
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- TAB: Capture -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-capture">

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">📸</span> Camera Setup</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Phone Camera Settings</h3>
        <div class="checklist">
          <label><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> ✅ Use any smartphone (iPhone, Pixel, Galaxy)</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> ❌ Turn OFF HDR (causes ghosting)</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> ❌ Turn OFF panorama mode</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> 🔒 Lock focus &amp; exposure</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> ⚙️ ISO 100–400, Shutter ~1/60s</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Before You Start</h3>
        <div class="checklist">
          <label><input type="checkbox"> 🚪 Open all doors (all open or all closed)</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> 💡 Turn on all lights</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> 🚫 Remove moving objects (pets, people, fans)</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> 🪟 Keep windows consistent</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">📷</span> How to Capture</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>For Each Room</h3>
        <ol style="padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-dim);">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Enter the doorway — take 10–15 photos facing in</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Walk the perimeter — continuous path, 60–70% overlap</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Capture at multiple heights — standing + crouching</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Move to center and take more photos</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Pause at doorways between rooms for overlap</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">📊</span> Photo Count Guide</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Room</th><th>Photos</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Small bedroom</td><td>50–75</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Large bedroom</td><td>75–100</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Kitchen</td><td>100–150</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Living room</td><td>150–200</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Bathroom</td><td>75–100</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Hallway</td><td>25–50</td></tr>
            <tr style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-light);"><td>Total (typical house)</td><td>300–500</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">🎥</span> Video Capture (Easier)</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>Instead of stopping for each photo, record video while walking:</p>
        <ol style="padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
          <li>Enable 4K video on your phone</li>
          <li>Walk slowly through each room</li>
          <li>Maintain consistent overlap — don't rush</li>
          <li>Capture at multiple heights</li>
        </ol>
        <pre style="background: #0d0d18; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--green); font-family: var(--font-mono);">
# Extract frames from video (4 FPS)
extract-frames.bat "C:\video.mp4" "C:\frames"</pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">⚠️</span> Common Problems</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>White Wall Problem</h3>
        <p>Plain walls have no texture → COLMAP can't compute positions → holes in reconstruction.</p>
        <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Hold newspaper/cardboard in front of blank walls, or capture from many angles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Ghosting / Blurring</h3>
        <p>Usually caused by HDR mode or moving objects.</p>
        <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Turn off HDR, remove people/pets/fans, re-capture.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- TAB: Hardware -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-hardware">

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">🖥️</span> Your System</h2>
      <div class="status-grid">
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">GPU</div>
          <div class="value green">RTX 5060 12GB</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">Architecture</div>
          <div class="value green">Blackwell (SM 12.0)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">CPU</div>
          <div class="value green">Ryzen 7 3800x</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">RAM</div>
          <div class="value green">32 GB</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">OS</div>
          <div class="value green">Windows 11</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="label">VRAM Usage</div>
          <div class="value orange">~6–12 GB</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">📈</span> Hardware Comparison</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Component</th><th>Minimum</th><th>Recommended</th><th>Large House</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>GPU</td><td>RTX 3060 6 GB</td><td>RTX 3080 12 GB</td><td>RTX 4090 24 GB</td></tr>
            <tr><td>VRAM</td><td>6 GB</td><td>12 GB</td><td>24 GB</td></tr>
            <tr><td>RAM</td><td>16 GB</td><td>32 GB</td><td>64 GB</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Storage</td><td>30 GB SSD</td><td>60 GB SSD</td><td>200 GB NVMe</td></tr>
            <tr><td>CUDA</td><td>11.8+</td><td>12.x</td><td>12.x</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">⏱️</span> Training Times</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>GPU</th><th>Time (300–500 photos)</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>RTX 4090 24 GB</td><td>25–40 min</td></tr>
            <tr><td>RTX 3090 24 GB</td><td>45–55 min</td></tr>
            <tr style="background: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.08); font-weight: 600;"><td>RTX 5060 12 GB ⚡</td><td>~45–90 min</td></tr>
            <tr><td>RTX 3080 12 GB</td><td>60–90 min</td></tr>
            <tr><td>RTX 3060 6 GB</td><td>90 min – 3 hrs</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.8rem;">* Plus 20–60 minutes for <a href="https://colmap.github.io/" target="_blank" class="service-link">COLMAP</a> preprocessing (CPU-bound)</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span class="icon">⚠️</span> Blackwell (RTX 50 Series) Note</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>Your RTX 5060 uses <strong>Blackwell architecture (SM 12.0)</strong>, the newest NVIDIA GPU architecture.</p>
        <p>The official 3DGS code doesn't compile for it out of the box. Use the <strong>patched versions</strong> that include Blackwell support:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
          <li><strong>feiyunwill/gaussian-splatting-cuda</strong> — patched INRIA with Blackwell SM 12.0 support</li>
          <li><strong>Nerfstudio / gsplat</strong> — Blackwell support merged in mid-2025</li>
          <li><strong>OpenSplat</strong> — multi-backend, reportedly works on Blackwell</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">All our scripts handle this automatically. You just need CUDA 12.4+ installed.</p>
        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">
          <a href="https://github.com/feiyunwill/gaussian-splatting-cuda" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">🔧 feiyunwill/gaussian-splatting-cuda</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/nerfstudio" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">🦦 Nerfstudio</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/pierotofy/OpenSplat" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">🗂️ OpenSplat</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

